// GSTINs, PANs, phone numbers, emails, addresses, or amounts tied to anyone. Codes like
// "PILOT01", "LEDG-1001", "V-PARTY-007" are placeholders defined by DATA_CONTRACT.md.
//
// Owns (see CONTRACTS.md task split — do not hand-edit these, re-run this script instead):
//   fixtures/synthetic/branch-PILOT01/run-001/{manifest.json,transactions.csv,trial_balance.csv,EXPECTED.md}
//   fixtures/synthetic/branch-PILOT01/run-002-dup/{manifest.json,transactions.csv,trial_balance.csv}
//   config/cutover-matrix.json
//   config/mapping-rules.json
//   config/smart-pharma-evidence.json
//   config/users.example.json (dev bearer tokens are printed to stdout ONLY, never written to disk)

